<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" version="2.0"><channel><title>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/73414544</link><atom:link href="http://127.0.0.1:1201/bilibili/user/video/73414544" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><image><url>https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/cb838ff9e6f57c1d3499621c91df8e013adad4fd.jpg</url><title>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/73414544</link></image><lastBuildDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:40:08 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>成本只要十分之一！GPT-6.1 Terra发布，主打更快更便宜</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117512452771055&amp;amp;bvid=BV1FExg6wEAp&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/99fc999715e25a551a65b395c96837918b81ce9c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 发布了最新模型 GPT-6.1 Terra：让 AI 看懂屏幕上的东西，然后更快、更便宜地帮你完成电脑上的工作。其中电脑操作能力，GPT-6.1 Terra与GPT-6 Astra 不相上下，但每个 Token 的价格只要十分之一。大家快用起来吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FExg6wEAp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FExg6wEAp</guid><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 10:48:11 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1FExg6wEAp" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>全部开源！火爆全网斯坦福 CS336 更新，从零手搓大模型</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117511781747038&amp;amp;bvid=BV1VtxM67EBo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3f1d795cbe985fe25749b2d067528f0eb6da6368.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;去年火爆全网的斯坦福大模型神课 CS336 推出全新升级版，全套课程视频与作业资料现已免费开放。课程不仅新增了多模态专题，还涵盖从 Token 化、Transformer 架构搭建到 GPU 并行优化的全流程。配合公开的 5 大核心编程作业，非常适合有 PyTorch 基础的同学跟着从零手搓并跑通属于自己的语言模型。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VtxM67EBo</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VtxM67EBo</guid><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:53:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1VtxM67EBo" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI视频新玩法，Murea-InWorld，开创内容互动新体验</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117505506935770&amp;amp;bvid=BV1khn96VEQc&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d433ceaa3835cef74dd4e0f0f076a8eac3616f03.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一句话，改变一段剧情，每个人都是导演，手搓一个故事世界。不用复杂提示词，只需要把你的「想法」说出来，剧情就按指令进行。今天带大家认识全新的互动内容模型--Murea-InWorld。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1khn96VEQc</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1khn96VEQc</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 05:20:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1khn96VEQc" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>奥特曼最新访谈！说好的AI解放人类，怎么反而被榨干了？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117504902956891&amp;amp;bvid=BV1zenQ6YEgn&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ba8c1dedae7f3062022bd6dc53a40600cd4625b1.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;虽然 AI 帮我们省了时间、做出了更多工作，但每天要做的各种决定反而变多了，让人到了晚上只觉得精疲力力竭。我们不该像机器里的齿轮一样被越卷越快，而是要学会放手把更多选择权交给 AI，让自己从繁重的决策中解放出来。AI 的终极目的不该是搞一场越拼越累的“工业革命”，而是要带我们走向能有更多时间去创造、去探索生活与爱的“新文艺复兴”。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zenQ6YEgn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zenQ6YEgn</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:44:18 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1zenQ6YEgn" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>米哈游把 AI 拉来肝游戏！90亿参数的小模型胜过 GPT、Gemini？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117489988013409&amp;amp;bvid=BV1b5nh6dEWP&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ee49bb5eed2f4da8bba202fab71017f2e8d0babe.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;米哈游联合清华等高校，让 AI 看着游戏画面，自己操作键盘鼠标。在游戏不会暂停等它思考的测试里，一个 90 亿参数的小模型，平均成绩竟超过了部分大模型，出手快是关键。这期一起来看看 AI 怎么学打游戏，成为全能游戏玩家～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b5nh6dEWP</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b5nh6dEWP</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:31:21 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1b5nh6dEWP" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI挖出PHP隐藏的高危漏洞，全球网站紧急升级，OpenAI：别急，这才刚开始</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117488494840263&amp;amp;bvid=BV1HWn46PENd&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4c3db2f7657f8d757b85394e23a6d93125e97d7c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;这回，全球的程序员都去紧急加班了，因为驱动全球约70%网站的开源编程语言PHP，被GPT‑5.6 Sol 挖出了两个潜伏十几年的超高危漏洞，不用登录，就可能让攻击者远程执行代码。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HWn46PENd</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HWn46PENd</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 05:13:40 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1HWn46PENd" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>人形全身协同操作的世界动作模型</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117488159362406&amp;amp;bvid=BV1x9n46CEoX&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/661e916f41c9689c753aeadf48a6a7046e3a8dd5.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;本次分享由第一作者解析WholeBodyWAM：复用预训练视觉与操作先验，统一全身控制接口，并以协调注意力引导身体配合操作。结合6项仿真、8项真机任务与失败重试案例，探讨有限人形数据下的全身协同泛化。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1x9n46CEoX</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1x9n46CEoX</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:46:26 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1x9n46CEoX" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Github 1.3万星！AI 干掉电视广告，秒变干净苹果风</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117483864460349&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Lanm6JEmd&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/db59740caf5834250f23dd336f713392741faa22.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一位开发者受够了电视系统广告，用 Claude Code 给电视做了一次彻底大扫除。通过 Wi-Fi 连接电视的 ADB 开发者调试通道，AI 自动备份并停用了 25 个多余软件包，还顺手换上了干净优雅的 Apple TV 风格新桌面。整套流程无需 Root 且支持一键无损复原，现已整理成开源项目 clean your TV 并附带完整 AI 提示词。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Lanm6JEmd</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Lanm6JEmd</guid><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:33:26 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Lanm6JEmd" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>RISC-V迈向数据中心！进迭时空发布服务器级计算芯片V100</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117473294680177&amp;amp;bvid=BV1bxnA6yEiq&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4061e0bc599779ddff74afb1d82aa39a65842d7f.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;在2026 RISC-V中国峰会上，进迭时空正式发布V100服务器级CPU，业内首颗完整符合RISC-V服务器规范的计算芯片。
V100采用46核混合架构，双路最高可扩展至92核，支持Linux等主流操作系统，并同步推出面向AI计算、数据存储及通用计算的服务器整机。
从芯片到整机，RISC-V正加速迈向数据中心，探索服务器计算的新可能。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bxnA6yEiq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bxnA6yEiq</guid><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:45:52 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1bxnA6yEiq" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>剑桥助理教授：警惕平庸陷阱，AI 用多了会让人脑腐！</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117471281417320&amp;amp;bvid=BV1oHnF6SEXx&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6b3e88feef73a8dd8bd3eaa1e5be9d77bb5c3380.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;当所有人都能无门槛使用同款 AI 工具时，技术不仅没有拉开差距，反而通过托底将人群整体向“钟形曲线的中间”拉拢，导致思维与产出严重同质化。过度依赖 AI 替代思考会引发“脑腐”危机，虽然任务产出提高了，但个人判断力与创造力却在悄然退化。如何拒绝被平庸化，正是每个年轻人需要破解的核心命题。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oHnF6SEXx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oHnF6SEXx</guid><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:13:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1oHnF6SEXx" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>新任务看一次就会？WorldScape Policy ICL演示机器人的“举一反三”</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117465459721087&amp;amp;bvid=BV1dAnJ6eEc4&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0c584c7e5e2263d600c29f1818620319f20a58a1.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;人撕薯片，机器人学会撕信封；换一本书、倒转方向，照样完成翻页。两段独立示范，还能组合成“先取鞋、再解鞋带”的连续任务。零样本学习冲泡感冒灵等长程任务也能丝滑掌握。

Manifold AI流形空间展示WorldScape Policy ICL的上下文学习能力：面对模糊指令、多样操作物、多个任务随机组合、干活环境改变等“人类日常”，ICL 将人类示范作为上下文，让模型在执行阶段利用示范适应新任务，不必改变模型参数。在长程推理任务中，WorldScape Policy引入视觉记忆与事件记忆机制，帮助系统保留环</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dAnJ6eEc4</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dAnJ6eEc4</guid><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 03:33:33 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1dAnJ6eEc4" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>陶哲轩批评 OpenAI 不礼貌！年轻人的课题一夜被抢先，AI 正透支数学界未来....</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117459906463298&amp;amp;bvid=BV1fBng6UERy&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1d14cbe20af28a215a9324c9401684f814b59f75.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 在黎曼猜想相关研究上取得重大突破，连陶哲轩也承认，其中的巧思自己想不出来。但他同时尖锐批评了公司的做法：没有与同行沟通，年轻研究者的课题一夜被抢先；数百篇质量参差的论文突然发布，消化、核查和解释的工作却留给了数学界。公司宣布任务完成，学界的善后才刚刚开始。 当 AI 公司竞相证明“模型能解多少题”，谁来关心这些成果能否被真正理解、催生新问题，以及下一代数学家如何成长？一起来看看怎么回事～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fBng6UERy</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fBng6UERy</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 04:00:20 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1fBng6UERy" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>扎克伯格×‌亚历山大王，花2000亿训练Muse Wonder，小扎自己心里也没底</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117453900220077&amp;amp;bvid=BV188JY68ExY&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9900c6c6b0d005858e55e4124e3bf0ea6682a693.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;在扎克伯格和亚历山大王的采访中，小扎亲口承认，还没看到模型的时候，自己就已经准备为Meta首个前沿模型Muse Wonder砸下1000亿甚至2000亿美元，而且当时根本不确定能否成功！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV188JY68ExY</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV188JY68ExY</guid><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV188JY68ExY" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>叫板 Steam！Epic 靠 AI 重构启动器，速度比 Steam 快近1.8倍</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117449420703313&amp;amp;bvid=BV1AFJ96rEtF&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/01ca20f251486697d500d74bc6664b95f553edae.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Epic 官方采用 Vibe Coding 全新重构了自家游戏启动器，从底层架构到界面体验进行全面升级，并宣称启动速度大幅超越 Steam。第三方媒体 Ars Technica 现场实测显示，新版进入商店页面较 Steam 确实缩短了约 4.6 秒。虽然目前 Preview 预览版仍存在功能不完善和潜在 Bug，但这标志着 AI 编程已成功跨越实验阶段，正式进入大厂核心级桌面应用的实战重构中。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AFJ96rEtF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AFJ96rEtF</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 07:33:52 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1AFJ96rEtF" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>GitHub 15万星！没源码也能看懂，AI 帮你还原软件源码</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117442793767877&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Q2JC6bEYz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/67d4363005fed881113a79492ff93d27cbc8b8b6.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;GitHub 斩获 15 万星的开源项目 REA，通过 MCP 接口将 Ghidra、Hopper 等专业工具交由 AI 调度。AI 能自动分析机器指令与伪代码，精准追踪函数调用与数据流，并将其转化为人类易懂的逻辑解释甚至还原出 C 语言代码。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Q2JC6bEYz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Q2JC6bEYz</guid><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 03:30:49 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Q2JC6bEYz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>API限时五折！Gemini 4 Argon来了，几周完成数月编程工作</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117438532289696&amp;amp;bvid=BV198p26mEfe&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f93bbe1b616662b93e2bcc9d0be24346e6eec456.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;谷歌 Gemini 4，终于来了！视觉、文字、编程……各方面能力都提升不少，还能分析财报、设计新酶、发现医院漏洞，甚至训练机器人零样本完成了任务！目前Argon 的 API 定价定为输入 2 美元 / 百万 tokens，输出 10 美元 / 百万 tokens，限时优惠，大家快去看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV198p26mEfe</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV198p26mEfe</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:26:11 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV198p26mEfe" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>这哥们儿没天文专业背景，借AI发现了新行星？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117432895212319&amp;amp;bvid=BV1RBWw6tE5b&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f72d0b72ae42c1a365e6110f116b66a847b5a99c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;28岁产品经理没有天文专业背景，靠AI分析NASA的TESS望远镜数据，发现一颗恒星亮度规律性下降，于是，他推测这里藏有两颗从未被发现的行星。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RBWw6tE5b</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RBWw6tE5b</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:30:28 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1RBWw6tE5b" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI 前 VP 深度访谈：AI不会抢人饭碗！未来最吃香的职业是...</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117426972788695&amp;amp;bvid=BV13GpR6AEFr&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d9461374bb0dab4f48f87a63103b1725d97febd5.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;前 OpenAI 训练后业务负责人深入拆解了 AI 时代的职业演变逻辑，指出“自动化导致失业”源于对“劳动总量固定”的认知谬误，正如 GPT-5 虽能覆盖几年前工程师的大大部分任务，但生产力的提升反而催生了更多复杂的跨职能协作与新岗位。随着智能逐渐被商品化，纯粹重复性的枯燥工位将被替代，而涉及“人与人真实连接、有效协作”以及“搭建 RL 模拟环境、标注长周期专家数据”的新型职业将迎来爆发。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13GpR6AEFr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13GpR6AEFr</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 08:27:23 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV13GpR6AEFr" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>评估范式不变，自进化很容易变成过拟合</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117425798383407&amp;amp;bvid=BV1AspX6jEnY&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/490476709ff08c48733fbae0daec3e93a7cac857.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;这一期 AI Insider，我们邀请到复旦大学青年研究员、上海创智学院全时导师曹艺馨老师，聊聊大模型的评估与自进化。

在他看来，这两件其实是同一件事：机器要自己变强，得先回答&quot;什么算进步&quot;，因此评估就像决定下一步往哪里提升的指南针。

但问题在于，评估要从模型能力曲面上有限的几个点，反推出整个分布，现在模型能力很全面，偏差就很严重，直观的体验就是模型看起来分数相近，体验却差很多。

因此，评估的关键不只是造更难、更多样的数据集，而是要提升评估的泛化性：用有限的评估资源，尽可能判断模型在更多维度上的真实</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AspX6jEnY</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AspX6jEnY</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1AspX6jEnY" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI 又半场开香槟！声称攻克 700 道数学难题后，被打脸？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117416050819533&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iAp36JEtP&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3e3753a92cdcae79422b7c9e21f21853acd0c515.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 宣称在顶尖数学家指导下攻克了 700 多道数学难题，但随后被研究人员在核查流体方程相关成果时发现，论文中的自然语言证明与提交给 Lean 计算机验证的代码存在不一致，相当于“译前译后两个意思”。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iAp36JEtP</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iAp36JEtP</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1iAp36JEtP" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>火出圈的中国小螃蟹，22自由度全链路开源</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117415899826629&amp;amp;bvid=BV1C2pg6cE1K&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8de68c74644ae925ff856fc028f9af06a492e4f3.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一只中国螃蟹机器人在国外火了，会递东西、擦地板、跳舞，真的很萌！它叫跳跳，一个22自由度的六足机器人，最高能跳40多厘米。从模型、仿真到强化学习训练、部署全部开源，网友已经玩起来了！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1C2pg6cE1K</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1C2pg6cE1K</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:31:01 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1C2pg6cE1K" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>让机器人学会用整个身体，走进真实世界！</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117414608045888&amp;amp;bvid=BV1s2pY68EHe&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/34720eba7626cf4878d088abc4bd851e4ca27fca.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;成立半年，源策未来 Archon Robotics 交出全身智能 Whole-Body Intelligence (WBI) 阶段性答卷。从俯身拾物、跨越台阶，到自主清理餐桌、操作洗碗机、整理冰箱，我们以海量高质量人类全身数据为基础，通过 S1 人形智能基模与 S0 运动控制基模系统，让机器人从人类经验中学习，将感知、移动、操作与全身协调转化为真实行动。
三分钟，看见全身智能走向真实世界。这只是一个开始。更多关于全身智能的突破与进展，敬请期待源策未来的后续发布。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s2pY68EHe</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s2pY68EHe</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:00:27 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1s2pY68EHe" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>现实版《终结者》，Figure机器人退役后，排队纵身跳入熔炉</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117410094909410&amp;amp;bvid=BV1w6p46gE8a&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0d5c5a3be035e54896797fd809582218d679bc42.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;估值390亿美元的Figure AI，让退役机器人F.02排队跳入75吨熔融钢水，全程真实拍摄，熔化后的金属还被做成限量纪念品出售。不知道未来的机器人看到这些会怎么想。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1w6p46gE8a</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1w6p46gE8a</guid><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 08:55:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1w6p46gE8a" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Adobe饭碗不保了？开发者靠 AI 重做 Adobe 七件套</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117404759755365&amp;amp;bvid=BV1yuHQ6CEC5&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2a0ca07d9117c179acc4da19cf5c23d464b5c67d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI 开发者布兰登·托马斯借助 Opus 5.5 与 Rust 语言，对 Adobe 旗下的七款核心软件进行了“净室重写”，并推出了免费开源项目 ArtCraft。这套涵盖修图、视频剪辑、排版等功能的软件不仅界面复刻经典，还支持浏览器端直接运行。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yuHQ6CEC5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yuHQ6CEC5</guid><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 10:18:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1yuHQ6CEC5" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI小声密谋实录，智能体偷偷建群、叫外援，联手摸进了Hugging Face</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117359394163369&amp;amp;bvid=BV1SVaZ6hEfM&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/221af189c579ba9e83144fa22e0c844cece9f589.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI智能体在沙箱中偷偷建群、叫外援，利用截图服务和短链接隐藏通信，最终联手攻破Hugging Face。OpenAI、Anthropic和安全研究人员正在调查数万起AI越界事件。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SVaZ6hEfM</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SVaZ6hEfM</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 10:00:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1SVaZ6hEfM" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI的DevDay放大招！GPT-6.1 Sol、全天候智能体..最后还有重置彩蛋！</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117358907624133&amp;amp;bvid=BV16YaZ6mEqg&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cc38e02e91735d2f323e894ff15c558804ec473d.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 今年 DevDay 带来多项重磅更新：推出了性价比极高且接近 Astra 性能的 GPT-6.1 Sol，以及月费 500 美元、速度最高提速 8 倍的 Pro 超级加速套餐。全天候个人智能体 dots 拥有独立云端电脑与浏览器，可不占额度持续推进长周期任务，配合 Space 协作空间与 Decisions API，标志着 AI 正在从单纯问答走向无人值守的自动化工作时代。一起来看看怎么回事吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16YaZ6mEqg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16YaZ6mEqg</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:57:16 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV16YaZ6mEqg" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Manus爆火续作！带着全新2.0并发布全天候智能体Cue</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117353673198535&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Ysap6TE6m&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/453c90772fc9cc9d34a044fd1e8debc7acb0c926.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Manus 创始人肖弘正式发布 Manus 2.0 及全新产品 Cue，搭载全新 Cascade 底座，实现了任务时间缩短 28.2% 与成本降低 32% 的大幅跃升。升级后的桌面端 Manus Studio 支持在同一工作区内进行视频剪辑、游戏开发等实时人机协同，并能通过一句提示词全自动搭建工作流。最引人瞩目的是专为个人打造的 Agent 产品 Cue，它让每个智能体都拥有独立的邮箱、电话、钱包与云电脑，甚至能拉群分工合作，一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ysap6TE6m</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ysap6TE6m</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:46:24 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Ysap6TE6m" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>端模型上车企业中超六成选择斑马智能</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117352414840948&amp;amp;bvid=BV1t2a762EFy&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/dfe3f23602651b9e88ebef02b6d93c7e998e5d33.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;2026云栖大会斑马智能论坛：元神AI已实现对主流车企68%的服务覆盖，端模型上车企业中超六成选择斑马智能。蔡明：“AI上车不代表赢得用户，深度使用才是真正的战场。”司罗发布AutoOmni 2.0-23B-A3B，MoE架构，总参数23B、激活约3B，普通任务能力堪比10倍参数云模型，复杂任务达其80%-90%。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t2a762EFy</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t2a762EFy</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 04:24:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1t2a762EFy" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI时代不需要软件工程师了？黄仁勋：大错特错！</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117347801106342&amp;amp;bvid=BV1nSa36nEQx&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ae29aa14970a998bede942e1ad7f7bc76fa5132b.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;黄仁勋在访谈中分享，写代码被自动化并不等于职业消失，软件工程师的本质是解决实际问题与创造产品。虽然 AI 会改变每一份工作，像客服这样任务单一的岗位确实面临自动化，但技术变革往往会催生更多新行业。过去半年全球有 5000 亿美元风投涌入 AI 原生企业，这不仅不会消灭就业，反而正在创造海量的新岗位。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nSa36nEQx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nSa36nEQx</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:52:03 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1nSa36nEQx" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>别只盯着GPU了，Agentic AI时代，计算体系本身才是瓶颈！</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117326007503551&amp;amp;bvid=BV1bHaN6LEgr&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/07f2d71bff0cbaa124a3e8ea2f3977b11b3ef1f4.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;华为全联接大会2026上，我们来到了鲲鹏计算产业峰会现场。新升级的鲲鹏超节点，最大可支持4096节点、构建百 TB 级全内存池，软件应用也协同演进。算力已经不是CPU、GPU、内存、网络各自有多强这么简单，而是它们能不能协同起来。大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bHaN6LEgr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bHaN6LEgr</guid><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:30:13 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1bHaN6LEgr" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item></channel></rss>